      "content": "i guess. but it's hard to see the beauty in just being a burden. everything feels like it's just being dragged out. there's no point in trying to fight the inevitable when you've already lost everything that made you, you. sometimes i think it would be more respectful to myself to just decide when the story ends, instead of letting it just rot away like this.",
